s the rabbit and the rabbit likes the mouse then the dog likes the mouse."This statement does not provide any information about the dog\'s color.\n   - "If the dog eats the rabbit and the rabbit likes the mouse then the dog likes the mouse."This statement does not provide any information about the dog\'s color.\n   - "If the cat chases the rabbit then the cat chases the dog."This statement does not provide any information about the dog\'s color.\nThe dog is not blue, which means the statement "The dog is blue" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
