While it is clear that the rabbit visits the bald eagle, there is no indication that it visits the cow. Therefore, from the information provided, we can confidently state that the rabbit does not visit the cow.\n\nHence, it can be definitively concluded that the rabbit does not visit the cow. The correct answer is:\n\n**B) False**. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
